{"version":1,"content":"<p>AMD高管傑克·黃（Jack Huynh）與超頻玩家聯手，藉助液氮將Radeon RX 9060 XT的GPU核心頻率推升至4837兆赫茲，刷新了GPU頻率世界紀錄。該成績此前紀錄為4789兆赫茲，新紀錄高出48兆赫茲。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587922.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:43:53.601632+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T06:33:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T06:37:13.741601+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:37:13.741601+00:00","content_hash":"67c16644c7b7bc4729eb6d0b0acc4c499cbdde4f8d04e7df6b08378860111c06","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}